OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted of 'abusive'        
OL,4,Abehaviour on Jet2 flight               
OL,6,FA man who became "aggressive and       
OL,7,Fabusive" when asked to leave a flight  
OL,8,Fbefore take-off has been convicted at  
OL,9,Fcourt.                                 
OL,11,FSackab Ali, 41, was one of six men told
OL,12,Fto leave the Marrakesh-bound plane at  
OL,13,FLeeds Bradford Airport on 3 October    
OL,14,F2025 after they were seen drinking     
OL,15,Fshots and passing around a box of      
OL,16,FViagra tablets.                        
OL,18,FFather-of-five Ali, from Bradford,     
OL,19,Fadmitted being "very mad" at being told
OL,20,Fto leave the Jet2 plane, but denied    
OL,21,Fintentionally interfering with the     
OL,22,Fperformance of air crew members' duty. 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
