OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted of 'abusive'        
OL,4,Abehaviour on Jet2 flight               
OL,6,FHe is due to be sentenced at Leeds     
OL,7,FCrown Court on 11 December after a     
OL,8,Fjudge told him the offence was too     
OL,9,Fserious to be dealt with by a fine,    
OL,10,Fwhich was the maximum punishment       
OL,11,Favailable to him.                      
